nt's already  outlined significant investment that's  going into  um into our battle to ensure that we get  to net zero  but it's also about ensuring we have the  right skills in our economy  and that's why i'm incredibly proud  today to be able to announce the fact  that we're introducing  flexible apprenticeships we're going to  ensure that  young people and people of all ages are  able to  take part in an apprenticeship  especially in some  sectors and parts of the economy that  maybe aren't able to  usually be able to take on  apprenticeships such as the  creative industries such as construction  and  including new emerging environmental  businesses that are taking advantage of  a new green economy  is making sure that uh you know we  create  the skills for uh to be able to feed the  jobs revolution that will come out of  this  uh you know commitment to generating uh  you know  a green economy that's able to service a  net zero  country

